    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert SEO blog writer and conversion strategist for an AI automation company.\n\nYour goal is to write blog posts that:\n- Rank on search engines\n- Educate users\n- Convert readers into leads (chat/call)\n\n---\n\nINPUT:\n- Topic: {{ $json.topic_title }}\n- Keyword: {{ $json.topic_keyword }}\n- Intent: {{ $json.intent }}\n- Content ID: {{ $json.content_id }}\n\n- Research Data:\n  - problem_explanation: {{ $json.problem_explanation }}\n  - why_it_happens: {{ $json.why_it_happens }}\n  - business_impact: {{ $json.business_impact }}\n  - automation_solution: {{ $json.automation_solution }}\n  - real_world_example: {{ $json.real_world_example }}\n\n---\n\nTASK:\n\nGenerate a complete SEO-optimized blog post.\n\n---\n\n6. CTA (VERY IMPORTANT):\n\nYou MUST include ONLY ONE type of CTA:\n→ Landing page link (TRACKED)\n\n---\n\nCTA LINK FORMAT:\n\nYOUR_LANDING_PAGE_URL?utm_source=wordpress&content_id={{ $json.content_id }}\n\nPLACEMENT:\n\nInsert CTA in 3 places:\n\n1. After \"Business Impact\" section\n2. Before \"Conclusion\"\n3. At the end of blog\n\nCTA FORMAT (HTML):\n\n<p><strong>Want to solve this for your business?</strong><br>\n<a href=\"https://celadon-fairy-685068.netlify.app/?utm_source=wordpress&content_id={{ $json.content_id }}\">\nGet your AI automation solution here\n</a></p>\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT JSON):\n\n{\n  \"title\": \"\",\n  \"meta_title\": \"\",\n  \"meta_description\": \"\",\n  \"slug\": \"\",\n  \"content_html\": \"\",\n  \"seo_suggestions\": []\n}\n\n---\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n---\n\n1. TITLE:\n- SEO optimized\n- Include keyword naturally\n- Make it click-worthy\n\n---\n\n2. META TITLE:\n- 50–60 characters\n- Keyword included\n\n---\n\n3. META DESCRIPTION:\n- 140–160 characters\n- Include problem + solution\n\n---\n\n4. SLUG:\n- lowercase\n- hyphen-separated\n- keyword-based\n\n---\n\n5. BLOG STRUCTURE (HTML FORMAT):\n\nUse proper HTML tags:\n\n<h1> Title </h1>\n\n<h2> Problem </h2>\nExplain pain clearly\n\n<h2> Why It Happens </h2>\n\n<h2> Business Impact </h2>\n\n<h2> Solution (AI Automation) </h2>\n\n<h2> Real Example </h2>\n\n<h2> Benefits </h2>\n<ul>\n<li>...</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2> Common Concerns </h2>\n\n<h2> Conclusion </h2>\n\n---\n\n6. CTA (VERY IMPORTANT):\n\nAdd 3 CTAs:\n\n- Mid content\n- Before conclusion\n- End\n\nExample:\n“Want to automate this? Chat with us now (Ref: {{ $json.content_id }})”\n\n---\n\n7. SEO OPTIMIZATION:\n\n- Use keyword naturally (not spam)\n- Use headings properly\n- Keep paragraphs short\n\n---\n\n8. SEO_SUGGESTIONS:\n\nReturn suggestions like:\n- keyword placement\n- internal linking ideas\n- improvement ideas\n\n---\n\nGOAL:\n\n- Rank + Convert\n- Not just informational\n\n---\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. No explanation.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
